{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "刃", "id": "刃"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "異", "id": "異"}, {"form": "禽獸", "id": "禽獸"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.0818051703517284, "source": "刃", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.468099531471619, "source": "刃", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.5709795465857378, "source": "今", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.1612467120315646, "source": "今", "target": "禽獸"}, {"weight": 1.7749523509116738, "source": "今", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9572739077056285, "source": "今", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.4312176042105791, "source": "今", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.403561010334048, "source": "後", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.3049487216659381, "source": "後", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.468099531471619, "source": "行", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.9420432279765697, "source": "行", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.1071229783360184, "source": "行", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.691243082785829, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9980959022258835, "source": "義", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 0.12629372532429206, "source": "義", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 0.8194409058842373, "source": "王", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.8194409058842373, "source": "王", "target": "在"}, {"weight": 0.5962973545700276, "source": "王", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.12629372532429206, "sou